      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing DynamoDB Fetch**\n\nI've just finished the `fetch_document.py` file. I used `boto3` to interact with AWS DynamoDB. The core function is named `fetch_document_by_id`, which handles the database connection and ID lookup. The code is commented so the provider is clear.\n\n\n**Refining DynamoDB Integration**\n\nI've just added comments to guide users through credential configuration, ensuring clarity for others. The function `fetch_document_by_id` now directly connects to the DynamoDB instance and fetches the document by its ID. My implementation relies heavily on `boto3`. I think it's ready for testing.\n\n\n",
